  m_text: '<i>Weapon Notes : </i>


    - Weapons can be configured with infinite
    ammo, physical reload, or timer.


    - Press A / X to Release Slide. Press
    B / Y to eject clips.


    - Ammo Capacity is 1:1 with magazine size : bullets
    are removed from the clip for each shot.


    - You can grab ammo from your
    waist holster when you have a weapon equipped

